				Simulated:
			</p>
			<ul class="mt-2 max-w-3xl space-y-1 text-base text-zinc-dust">
				<li class="border-l-2 border-oxblood-dark pl-3">
					the TOML parsing (a browser-side reader, not the Rust or dylib parser)
				</li>
				<li class="border-l-2 border-oxblood-dark pl-3">the resolution ladder</li>
				<li class="border-l-2 border-oxblood-dark pl-3">and the POST /reload response.</li>
